## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical use of Blob Storage for per-tenant isolation, TTL-based data retention, and a lightweight CI/CD approach.

## Key Concepts

- HTTP-triggered Azure Functions and streaming uploads
- Azure Blob Storage per-tenant isolation
- Azure App Configuration for per-tenant TTL
- Timer-triggered background cleanup
- Basic end-to-end tests and environment promotion via GitHub Actions

